{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Wayloom 是一款專為現代旅行者設計的智能假期規劃應用，能自動整理預訂郵件、電子票據與截圖，將散亂資訊化為有序行程。適合追求高效旅遊準備的用戶，現<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>下載，讓你輕鬆掌握每一次出發細節。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-159.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自動辨識並整合多源預訂</h2>\n<p>只需分享或上傳預訂郵件、PDF 機票、Wallet 通行證、日曆檔或螢幕截圖，App 即在裝置端本地讀取並分類航班、住宿、停車、租車、餐飲及活動。它提供日期排序的單一視圖，結合 Apple Maps 地址驗證、離線機場選擇、每日天氣預報及可自訂提醒。所有資料僅存於用戶 iCloud，無伺服器儲存，確保隱私安全且操作流暢。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-174-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-175-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-176-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-177-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-178-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-179-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Wayloom: Holiday Planner</li><li>應用類別：Travel</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/wayloom-holiday-planner/id6831969382?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:00:19.368306+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":330,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T00:44:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T20:17:53.543699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T00:53:54.011077+00:00","content_hash":"b05735e57c6392214ebe24702b0d83bb5ae5e69b52974d334953ed13cd2da538","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}